              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Frank A"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This salad is amazing and has great layers of flavor! I believe this is in part due to the pimento peppers - which are fantastic. The celery and roasted corn are also key. This salad is also very easy to make and healthy. If you need something great to bring to a summer BBQ - bring this!"
